{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2738198","formula":"FeAl₂(PO₄)₂(OH)₂","hill":"Al2FeH2O10P2","elements":["H","O","Al","P","Fe"],"composition":{"H":2.0,"O":10.0,"P":2.0,"Al":2.0,"Fe":1.0},"names":{"en":"Scorzalite","uk":"Скорцаліт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Scorzalite ((Fe2+,Mg)Al2(OH,PO4)2) is a dark blue phosphate mineral containing iron, magnesium, and aluminium phosphate. Scorzalite forms one endmember of a solid solution series with the lighter, more magnesium-rich lazulite. Scorzalite crystallizes in the monoclinic system in a dipyramidal form.","uk":"Скорцаліт ((Fe2+,Mg)Al2(OH,PO4)2) — темно-синій фосфатний мінерал, що містить фосфати заліза, магнію та алюмінію. Скорцаліт утворює один кінцевий член ряду твердих розчинів з легшим, більш багатим на магній лазулітом. Скорцаліт кристалізується в моноклінній системі в дипірамідальній формі."},"fame":15,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2738198","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scorzalite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%86%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%96%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scorzalite-245653.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q412651","formula":"MgAl₂(PO₄)₂(OH)₂","names":{"en":"Lazulite","ru":"Лазулит","uk":"Лазуліт"},"elements":["H","O","Mg","Al","P"],"fame":23,"kind":null},{"id":"Q3873297","formula":"NaAlPO₄(OH)","names":{"en":"Natromontebrasite","uk":"Натромонтебразит"},"elements":["H","O","Na","Al","P"],"fame":3,"kind":null},{"id":"Q409470","for